# Decrypted dumps keep the PFS0/HFS0 container layouts, mark gamecards DXCI and content archives DNCA, and set section
# encryption to None. Indirect/BKTR tables remain in decrypted patches. These changes use the pinned hactool's own
# parsers and preserve its encrypted paths; no game dump is modified. Header and indirect-table layouts follow the
# pinned hactool's nca.h, xci.h and bktr.h.
#
# CPM applies this patch (PATCHES in cmake/dependencies.cmake) once, when it unpacks hactool into its cache, and
# cmake/hactool.cmake checks the result. To change it, edit copies of the pristine nca.c and xci.c, rebuild the hunks
# with `diff -u --label a/<file> --label b/<file>`, and update the hashes in cmake/hactool.cmake.
